{"schema_version":1,"batch_id":"screening-0013","screening_model":"gpt-5.6-luna","reasoning":"medium","prompt_version":"gauss-screening-v1","item_count":22,"subject":"math","topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","total_weight":118,"expected_output":"screening-0013.output.jsonl","items":[{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0287","source_sha256":"f6c010cf6ae4a09e6a62469bed2f893dd5ba9bac7e6d2e2b3a3649c0c11e01f1","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $x - 1$ یکی از عوامل $x^3 + ax^2 - 3$ باشد، مجموع دو عامل دیگر کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0287/stem_1.webp","alt":"سوال 287","aspect_ratio":0.1645}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$2x + 1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2x + 2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2x + 3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2x + 4$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"$x-1$ یکی از عوامل $P = x^3 + ax^2 - x - 3$ است. بنابراین عبارت $P$ به ازای $x=1$ برابر صفر است.\n\n$x=1 \\Rightarrow P=0 \\Rightarrow 1+a-1-3=0 \\Rightarrow a=3$\n\nاکنون عبارت $P$ را بر $x-1$ تقسیم می‌کنیم:\n\n$P = x^3 + 3x^2 - x - 3 = (x-1)(x^2 + 4x + 3)$\n\n$= (x-1)(x+1)(x+3)$\n\nدو عامل دیگر $x+1$ و $x+3$ هستند که مجموع آن‌ها $2x+4$ می‌باشد."},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0287/solution_2.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۸۷","aspect_ratio":0.2762}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0287/solution_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0287/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0287/solution_2.webp","sha256":"b71765c68bafdd6e5dffd07a053e44847ebdce0b434c6034c7d96e2465244c9d","bytes":18590},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0287/stem_1.webp","sha256":"5c4cf2ffcb5cac73749a4a7365709620d17c5154ec6842017ec1340adcce3ebe","bytes":4984}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":287,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":29,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0288","source_sha256":"5ce6b4a934dc80e5652ad2abc17ca975fc289b9d387468b121411871100d881c","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در تجزیه عبارت $x^4 + ax^3 + x^2 + x + 2b$، یکی از عامل‌ها $x^2 - 1$ است. حاصل $b - a$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0288/stem_1.webp","alt":"سوال 288","aspect_ratio":0.1442}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"صفر"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"$x^2-1$ یکی از عوامل عبارت داده‌شده می‌باشد. در واقع عبارت دارای دو عامل $(x-1)$ و $(x+1)$ است و بنابراین به ازای $x=1$ و $x=-1$ برابر صفر است.\n\n$x=1 \\Rightarrow 1+a+1-1+2b \\Rightarrow a+2b = -1$\n\n$x=-1 \\Rightarrow 1-a+1+1+2b=0 \\Rightarrow -a+2b = -3$\n\n$\\Rightarrow 4b = -4 \\Rightarrow b=-1 \\Rightarrow a=1 \\Rightarrow a-b = 2$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0288/solution_2.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۸۸","aspect_ratio":0.2248}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0288/solution_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0288/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0288/solution_2.webp","sha256":"9d5c84ba0a19f9caecb52ec7a184ee32cfe2e87aec9125b1e7c7be53e8f44b72","bytes":13970},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0288/stem_1.webp","sha256":"6c888e5ff5ad3f20bc42cc2038aac59995e6dbdfc2cfa967a319ad07e81cba3b","bytes":5550}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":288,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":29,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0289","source_sha256":"a6ee201d2c3ef238a9d9d543a718ac116b8557d18e68c8f69fdf5d3c9079f3dc","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"یکی از عوامل ضرب عبارت $64x^4 + 1$ به صورت $ax^2 + bx + 1$ است. مقدار $b - a$ کدام می‌تواند باشد؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0289/stem_1.webp","alt":"سوال 289","aspect_ratio":0.1386}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$6$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$12$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-8$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-4$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"برای تجزیهٔ عبارت $64x^4 + 1$ عبارت $16x^2$ را اضافه و کم می‌کنیم:\n\n$64x^4 + 16x^2 + 1 - 16x^2 = (8x^2 + 1)^2 - 16x^2$\n\n$= (8x^2 + 1 - 4x)(8x^2 + 1 + 4x)$\n\nدو حالت وجود دارد:\n\n$ax^2 + bx + 1 = 8x^2 - 4x + 1 \\Rightarrow a=8 , b=-4$\n\n$ax^2 + bx + 1 = 8x^2 + 4x + 1 \\Rightarrow a=8 , b=4$\n\n$\\Rightarrow a-b = 12$\n\n$\\Rightarrow a-b = 4$\n\nمقدار ۱۲ در گزینه‌ها وجود دارد."},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0289/solution_2.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۸۹","aspect_ratio":0.3834}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0289/solution_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0289/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0289/solution_2.webp","sha256":"bfe1d210d99987bbaadc8f01406f9ea248a5192ec6d548aa205a2872d0c9cffc","bytes":22810},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0289/stem_1.webp","sha256":"448a08fca2377ac568c39b11f3cb62acadfeaf4fb713442115aa728918ecd9c3","bytes":8228}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":289,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":29,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0290","source_sha256":"7760266fc0874a505bcd357ccb28681ad7d17631bc59885aff76d31b1e23ebc2","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $a^3 - 27b^3 + (a - 3b)A$ یک اتحاد باشد، یکی از عوامل تجزیه $A + 7ab$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0290/stem_1.webp","alt":"سوال 290","aspect_ratio":0.1591}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$a - b$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$a - 9b$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$a + b$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$a + 10b$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا عبارت $A$ را محاسبه و ساده می‌کنیم.\n\n$a^3 = 27b^3 + (a - 3b)A \\Rightarrow A = \\frac{a^3 - 27b^3}{a - 3b}$\n\n$= \\frac{(a - 3b)(a^2 + 3ab + 9b^2)}{a - 3b} \\Rightarrow A = a^2 + 3ab + 9b^2$\n\n$\\Rightarrow A + 7ab = a^2 + 10ab + 9b^2 = (a+b)(a+9b)$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0290/solution_2.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۹۰","aspect_ratio":0.2395}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0290/solution_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0290/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0290/solution_2.webp","sha256":"059861e570f001b0a8959bf4c91de5e409c97787c3ddf9318758f91436171973","bytes":19204},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0290/stem_1.webp","sha256":"1a7acd3519b0d966d6bacac89d6821ae76548f98e0a1e053945447850d8ad397","bytes":6446}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":290,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":29,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0291","source_sha256":"e37497035ad85681d982bb84c49b44e88383d9bc62cb0006450220dfd5cbe060","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"حاصل $\\frac{x^6 - 1}{x^3 - 2x^2 - x + 2} \\times \\frac{x - 2}{x^2} = P$ به ازای $x = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$ چه‌قدر است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0291/stem_1.webp","alt":"سوال 291","aspect_ratio":0.2323}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{10}{3}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{11}{3}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$4$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{13}{3}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا عبارت $P$ را ساده می‌کنیم:\n\n$P = \\frac{x-2}{x^2} \\times \\frac{x^6 - 1}{x^3 - 2x^2 - x + 2} - \\frac{x-2}{x^2} \\times \\frac{(x^3 - 1)(x^3 + 1)}{(x-1)(x^2 - x - 2)}$\n\n$= \\frac{(x-2)}{x^2} \\times \\frac{(x-1)(x^2+x+1)(x+1)(x^2-x+1)}{(x-1)(x+1)(x-2)}$\n\n$= \\frac{(x^2+1)^2 - x^2}{x^2} = \\frac{x^4+x^2+1}{x^2}$\n\n$\\xrightarrow{x = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}} P = \\frac{(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3})^4 + (\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3})^2 + 1}{(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3})^2} = \\frac{\\frac{1}{9} + \\frac{1}{3} + 1}{\\frac{1}{3}} = \\frac{13}{3}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0291/solution_2.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۹۱","aspect_ratio":0.3957}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0291/solution_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0291/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0291/solution_2.webp","sha256":"7d6b8d950e12207a3dc760e528e4678f65a4fbe062824f8126433cbe750a5ff3","bytes":20348},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0291/stem_1.webp","sha256":"dd26dcb93a61d3d00396e355b98282cec78c80b4f4f3628bd159a7e732c544a8","bytes":4712}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":291,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":29,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0292","source_sha256":"3d18f7aef16d31948534de6167c3f07b48998c3044f5c32831f34439e08d3e1c","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اتحاد $\\frac{1}{x^2 - x - 2} = \\frac{B}{x - 2} + \\frac{A}{x + 1}$ برقرار است. $A - B$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0292/stem_1.webp","alt":"سوال 292","aspect_ratio":0.2544}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{3}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-\\frac{1}{3}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{2}{3}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-\\frac{2}{3}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"دو طرف تساوی را در $(x-2)(x+1)$ ضرب می‌کنیم.\n\n$\\frac{A}{x+1} + \\frac{B}{x-2} = \\frac{1}{x^2-x-2} \\Rightarrow A(x-2) + B(x+1) = 1$\n\n$\\Rightarrow (A+B)x - 2A + B = 1$\n\nبا توجه به اتحاد بودن تساوی بالا خواهیم داشت:\n\n$\\begin{cases} A+B=0 \\\\ -2A+B=1 \\end{cases} \\Rightarrow 3A = -1 \\Rightarrow A = -\\frac{1}{3} \\Rightarrow B = \\frac{1}{3}$\n\n$\\Rightarrow A-B = -\\frac{1}{3} - \\frac{1}{3} = -\\frac{2}{3}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0292/solution_2.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۹۲","aspect_ratio":0.2996}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0292/solution_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0292/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0292/solution_2.webp","sha256":"71930e224a13d817a694846db25fc21e3310d69e0b3ee17e878e3b9a9e4707e2","bytes":28664},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0292/stem_1.webp","sha256":"e5833ff6d16109b99680560f4b8fb94afaa69ae223faecc5cc8ce21fd0cd5205","bytes":7572}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":292,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":29,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0293","source_sha256":"2e619ffad9dacdb3c450d1994199051a10a682cf5a36f07e216f7e37962a1235","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"حاصل $P = \\frac{x^2 + 6x + k}{x^2 + 6x + 2}$ به ازای $x = \\sqrt{2} - 3$ برابر $2$ است. $k$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0293/stem_1.webp","alt":"سوال 293","aspect_ratio":0.1934}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$-1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$4$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"صورت و مخرج کسر را مربع کامل می‌کنیم:\n\n$P = \\frac{x^2+6x+k}{x^2+6x+2} = \\frac{(x+3)^2-9+k}{(x+3)^2-9+2}$\n\n$\\xrightarrow{x = \\sqrt{2}-3} P = \\frac{(\\sqrt{2})^2-9+k}{(\\sqrt{2})^2-7} = 2 \\Rightarrow \\frac{k-7}{-5} = 2$\n\n$\\Rightarrow k = -3$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0293/solution_2.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۹۳","aspect_ratio":0.2113}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0293/solution_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0293/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0293/solution_2.webp","sha256":"55071719cc1e87399951f30c0a7aa84ec1e27a370d0c27d4fa6ba39c3c6eb5b3","bytes":14060},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0293/stem_1.webp","sha256":"bc963ccd71f96f76ba1dc3da1f5b6cde86f980bda12935df60e35166a9e35b21","bytes":5126}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":293,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":29,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0294","source_sha256":"35d0ddf34c5022ccf574222c8a4221358f29a08054706a5a199ff0a3fcfd0588","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"ساده شدۀ $\\frac{2\\sqrt{x}}{x - 4} + \\frac{1 - \\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt{x} + 2} - \\frac{\\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt{x} - 2}$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0294/stem_1.webp","alt":"سوال 294","aspect_ratio":0.3085}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{3\\sqrt{x} - 2}{x - 4}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{2\\sqrt{x} - 3}{x - 4}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{\\sqrt{x} + 1}{x - 4}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{\\sqrt{x} - 1}{x - 4}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"روش اول: عبارت $x-4$ برابر با $(\\sqrt{x}-2)(\\sqrt{x}+2)$ است، بنابراین مخرج‌مشترک کسرها $x-4$ می‌باشد:\n\n$\\frac{\\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt{x}-2} + \\frac{1-\\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt{x}+2} - \\frac{2\\sqrt{x}}{x-4}$\n\n$= \\frac{\\sqrt{x}(\\sqrt{x}+2) + (1-\\sqrt{x})(\\sqrt{x}-2) - 2\\sqrt{x}}{x-4}$\n\n$= \\frac{x + 2\\sqrt{x} + 3\\sqrt{x} - x - 2 - 2\\sqrt{x}}{x-4} = \\frac{3\\sqrt{x}-2}{x-4}$\n\nروش دوم: عبارت داده‌شده به ازای $x=1$ برابر $-\\frac{1}{3}$ می‌شود. در بین گزینه‌های وجود تنها ۱ به ازای $x=1$ برابر $-\\frac{1}{3}$ می‌باشد."},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0294/solution_2.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۹۴","aspect_ratio":0.3954}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0294/solution_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0294/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0294/solution_2.webp","sha256":"18e54d6286c1b6e1e25a28de2d555ac088628199cf504c32f3ecc091b37b841d","bytes":20430},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0294/stem_1.webp","sha256":"06ce7c0b63fed521514e3ee4e6feede52dfcc13eaf80b80a89e553ebb6319405","bytes":388}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":294,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":7,"solution_page":29,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0295","source_sha256":"17d8eeda50fe97be6a77f14d58610716553a9d654621fdb8483e13c21d5b94c2","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"حاصل عددی عبارت $\\frac{1}{n(n+5)} + \\dots + \\frac{1}{12\\times17} + \\frac{1}{7\\times12} + \\frac{1}{2\\times7}$ برابر $\\frac{3}{32}$ است. $n$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"۲۲"}],[{"type":"text","text":"۲۷"}],[{"type":"text","text":"۳۲"}],[{"type":"text","text":"۳۷"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا هر یک از کسرها را تفکیک می‌کنیم:\n\n$\\frac{1}{2 \\times 7} = \\frac{1}{5}(\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{1}{7})$\n\n$\\frac{1}{7 \\times 12} = \\frac{1}{5}(\\frac{1}{7} - \\frac{1}{12})$\n\n$\\frac{1}{12 \\times 17} = \\frac{1}{5}(\\frac{1}{12} - \\frac{1}{17})$\n\n$\\vdots$\n\n$\\frac{1}{n(n+5)} = \\frac{1}{5}(\\frac{1}{n} - \\frac{1}{n+5})$\n\n$\\xrightarrow{+} \\frac{1}{5}(\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{1}{7} + \\frac{1}{7} - \\frac{1}{12} + \\frac{1}{12} - \\frac{1}{17} + \\dots + \\frac{1}{n} - \\frac{1}{n+5})$\n\n$= \\frac{1}{5}(\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{1}{n+5}) = \\frac{3}{32} \\Rightarrow \\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{1}{n+5} = \\frac{15}{32} \\Rightarrow \\frac{1}{n+5} = \\frac{1}{32}$\n\n$\\Rightarrow n = 27$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0295/solution_1.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۹۵","aspect_ratio":0.4487}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0295/solution_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0295/solution_1.webp","sha256":"509d96f6b9b679e3336e43190decb91414f1aa71088fbcc9a0598fdb5acbbacb","bytes":39486}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":295,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":29,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0296","source_sha256":"b9f315426f3fa688ed7b35e6671093c8fe77869a5daeb6942a13aca57ef801a6","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"ریشه $n$ ام و اعمال روی آن\nریشه‌های ششم عدد ۶۴ چه‌قدر با یکدیگر اختلاف دارند؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"۲"}],[{"type":"text","text":"۶"}],[{"type":"text","text":"۸"}],[{"type":"text","text":"۴"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"اعداد مثبت دارای دو ریشهٔ مرتبهٔ زوج هستند که قرینهٔ یکدیگرند.\n\nریشه‌های ششم ۶۴ برابر با $\\pm 2$ می‌باشند.\n\n$2 - (-2) = 4$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0296/solution_1.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۹۶","aspect_ratio":0.1294}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0296/solution_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0296/solution_1.webp","sha256":"b59503cf1cc0210c3a606fd2aac3147d514cbb97a05dbf5c144a94904ec00ece","bytes":11622}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":296,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":29,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0297","source_sha256":"8747b0f433312e60e0e64f38fdda31826f5ba94323d40e4d787efb3bc840451c","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"ریشه پنجم عدد $2\\sqrt{2}$ با ریشه سوم $a$ برابر است. $a$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2\\sqrt{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\sqrt{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$4$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ریشهٔ پنجم $2\\sqrt{4}$ را با $\\sqrt[5]{a}$ برابر قرار می‌دهیم.\n\n$\\sqrt[5]{2\\sqrt[3]{4}} = \\sqrt[5]{a} \\Rightarrow \\sqrt[5]{a} = \\sqrt[5]{2 \\times 2^{\\frac{2}{3}}} = \\sqrt[5]{2^{\\frac{5}{3}}} = 2^{\\frac{1}{3}} = \\sqrt[3]{2}$\n\n$\\Rightarrow a=2$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0297/solution_1.webp","alt":"حل سوال ۲۹۷","aspect_ratio":0.1524}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0297/solution_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0297/solution_1.webp","sha256":"c1d4d0b90755719e50869830ed45d256e25b4ed64286c36f6b795178ea6a5e0d","bytes":11114}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":297,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":29,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0298","source_sha256":"36855caa50c6f3c0976765b6376165e41bad4ff19485805503378fc35ff69cfb","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"عدد منفی $k$، ریشه چهارم $0/0256$ است و مجموع دو عدد $k$ و ریشه سوم $a$ برابر $0/1$ است. مقدار $a$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$0/125$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$0/025$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$0/027$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$0/216$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ریشه‌های چهارم $0/0256$ به صورت $\\pm\\sqrt[4]{0/0256}$ و ریشۀ سوم $a$ برابر $\\sqrt[3]{a}$ می‌باشد.\n$-\\sqrt[4]{0/0256} + \\sqrt[3]{a} = 0/1 \\Rightarrow -\\sqrt[4]{\\frac{256}{10^4}} + \\sqrt[3]{a} = 0/1$\n$\\Rightarrow -\\frac{4}{10} + \\sqrt[3]{a} = 0/1 \\Rightarrow \\sqrt[3]{a} = 0/5 \\Rightarrow a = 0/125$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0298/solution_1.webp","alt":"حل سوال 298","aspect_ratio":0.3245}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0298/solution_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0298/solution_1.webp","sha256":"c6d19c649048d53b2b81b094cd7ce0c97df8282b787fca58a4a135173e198500","bytes":23172}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":298,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":30,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0299","source_sha256":"8a774266ec722dd551cb59db08bfdca8d48246206af6fb5414717ededd2d5b3b","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"ریشه ششم ۱۶ با ریشه پنجم کدام عدد برابر است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$4\\sqrt[3]{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-8\\sqrt[3]{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$8\\sqrt{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-4\\sqrt{2}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ریشه‌های ششم $16$ برابر با $\\pm\\sqrt[6]{16}$ می‌باشند. اگر ریشۀ پنجم $x$ با ریشۀ ششم $16$ برابر باشد، خواهیم داشت:\n$\\sqrt[5]{x} = \\pm\\sqrt[6]{16} = \\pm\\sqrt[6]{2^4} = \\pm\\sqrt[3]{2^2}$\nدو طرف معادله را به توان $5$ می‌رسانیم:\n$x = \\pm\\sqrt[3]{2^{10}} = \\pm 2^3\\sqrt[3]{2} = \\pm 8\\sqrt[3]{2}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0299/solution_1.webp","alt":"حل سوال 299","aspect_ratio":0.253}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0299/solution_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0299/solution_1.webp","sha256":"83d256d0f70f5d3c256ba0d751e11cdf431faa146cd45133e32b5ca50ceca509","bytes":24242}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":299,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":30,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0300","source_sha256":"a59a1eb030f001c562ccfc0aeb82fffc77567baf50666a4c620a10a494c79eff","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"مربع ریشه چهارم ۷۲۹، چند واحد از مکعب ریشه ششم ۱۲۹۶ بیشتر است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"۹"}],[{"type":"text","text":"۳۶"}],[{"type":"text","text":"۲۷"}],[{"type":"text","text":"۶۳"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ریشۀ چهارم $729$ را $a$ و ریشۀ ششم $1296$ را $b$ می‌نامیم:\n$a = \\pm\\sqrt[4]{729} = \\pm\\sqrt[4]{3^6} = \\pm\\sqrt{3^3} \\Rightarrow a^2 = 3^3 = 27$\n$b = \\pm\\sqrt[6]{1296} = \\pm\\sqrt[6]{6^4} = \\pm\\sqrt[3]{6^2} \\Rightarrow b^3 = \\pm 6^2 = \\pm 36$\nمی‌بینیم که مکعب ریشۀ ششم $1296$ به دو صورت $\\pm 36$ است که با توجه به گزینه‌ها خواهیم داشت: $a^2 - b^3 = 27 - (-36) = 63$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0300/solution_1.webp","alt":"حل سوال 300","aspect_ratio":0.2725}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0300/solution_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0300/solution_1.webp","sha256":"fa65bd2d39471c2aff12601b64da2a8188729a40c310fbbb2c0a6d6b65f26808","bytes":20592}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":300,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":30,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0301","source_sha256":"6693471834b8c2ac713ad57bfb943a606b11d400bdcf6b052c6906e070183f3b","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $a$ ریشه هفتم عدد $4\\sqrt[3]{2}$ باشد، جواب معادله $\\sqrt{2} = ax$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\sqrt{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\sqrt[3]{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\sqrt[6]{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\sqrt[7]{4}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ریشۀ هفتم $4\\sqrt[3]{2}$ می‌باشد یعنی:\n$a = \\sqrt[7]{4\\sqrt[3]{2}} = \\sqrt[7]{2^2 \\times 2^{\\frac{1}{3}}} = \\sqrt[7]{2^{\\frac{7}{3}}} = \\sqrt[3]{2} = \\sqrt[6]{4}$\n$ax = \\sqrt{2} \\Rightarrow \\sqrt[6]{4}x = \\sqrt{2} \\Rightarrow x = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt[6]{4}} = \\frac{2^{\\frac{1}{2}}}{2^{\\frac{1}{3}}}$\n$= 2^{\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{1}{3}} = 2^{\\frac{1}{6}} = \\sqrt[6]{2}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0301/solution_1.webp","alt":"حل سوال 301","aspect_ratio":0.3573}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0301/solution_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0301/solution_1.webp","sha256":"1ebfdc1f0695afae429e4b3cf8c79f146290437051b2ae92f52d6d145fcf5fed","bytes":26712}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":301,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":30,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0302","source_sha256":"e9a934d667a64f8a688536217c052166298239e8f32f2584cedf7314524cc165","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اختلاف ریشه‌های ششم عدد ۱۶ را $A$ می‌نامیم. به ازای کدام مقدار $x$ تساوی $\\sqrt[5]{A\\sqrt[3]{4}} = 2^x$ برقرار است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"۱"}],[{"type":"text","text":"۲"}],[{"type":"text","text":"۳"}],[{"type":"text","text":"۴"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ریشه‌های ششم عدد $16$ برابر با $\\pm\\sqrt[6]{16}$ می‌باشند که اختلاف آن‌ها $2\\sqrt[6]{16}$ است بنابراین $A = 2\\sqrt[6]{16}$.\n$2^x = \\sqrt[4]{A\\sqrt[4]{4}} = \\sqrt[4]{2\\sqrt[6]{16}\\sqrt[4]{4}} = \\sqrt[4]{\\sqrt[6]{2^{10}}\\sqrt[4]{4}} = \\sqrt[4]{\\sqrt[12]{2^{20}}\\sqrt[4]{4}}$\n$= \\sqrt[4]{2\\sqrt[3]{4}} = \\sqrt[4]{2\\sqrt[4]{4}} = \\sqrt[8]{8} = 2 \\Rightarrow x=1$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0302/solution_1.webp","alt":"حل سوال 302","aspect_ratio":0.3249}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0302/solution_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0302/solution_1.webp","sha256":"c4f715e62ceb8bb7e5d83494c8e14c22d3af9b2208618a270de1582e767ea04a","bytes":29940}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":302,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":30,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0303","source_sha256":"92f415fa57f6f072426a66a792b895d2076bfa8cd99baf24e9d122dac2160149","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"با فرض $-1 < a < 0$، کدام صحیح است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\sqrt[3]{a} < a < a^3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$a^3 < a < \\sqrt[3]{a}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$a < a^2 < a^3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$a^3 < a^2 < a$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"$a^2$ عددی مثبت و $a$ و $a^3$ اعدادی منفی می‌باشند. بنابراین گزینه‌های 3 و 4 نادرست هستند. می‌دانیم:\n$-1 < a < 0 \\Rightarrow \\dots < \\sqrt[5]{a} < \\sqrt[3]{a} < a < a^3 < a^5 < \\dots$\nبنابراین 1 درست است."},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0303/solution_1.webp","alt":"حل سوال 303","aspect_ratio":0.2901}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0303/solution_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0303/solution_1.webp","sha256":"2ba683120d35cc1cc4430b5850a96507d3acc70632b55f0df57af3a29b74dc96","bytes":11866}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":303,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":30,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0304","source_sha256":"05099751d0f8d9da586763065ad8f5a98f86b57c401a7152f592995878a6c6ec","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $A = \\sqrt[3]{4}$، $B = \\sqrt[5]{5}$ و $C = \\sqrt[6]{16}$ باشد، کدام گزینه صحیح است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$C < B < A$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$B < A < C$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$A < B < C$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$B < C < A$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"می‌دانیم $A = \\sqrt[3]{4} = \\sqrt[6]{16}$ می‌باشد. ابتدا $A$ و $B$ را با یکدیگر مقایسه می‌کنیم. بدین منظور هر دو عدد را به توان $10$ می‌رسانیم:\n1) $\\begin{cases} A = \\sqrt{2} \\Rightarrow A^{10} = 2^5 = 32 \\\\ B = \\sqrt[5]{5} \\Rightarrow B^{10} = 5^2 = 25 \\end{cases} \\Rightarrow A^{10} > B^{10} \\Rightarrow A > B$\nاز طرفی $C = \\sqrt[6]{16} = \\sqrt[3]{4} = \\sqrt{2}$ :\nاکنون، $A$ و $C$ را مقایسه می‌کنیم.\n2) $\\begin{cases} A = \\sqrt{2} \\Rightarrow A^6 = 2^3 = 8 \\\\ C = \\sqrt[3]{4} \\Rightarrow C^6 = 4^2 = 16 \\end{cases} \\Rightarrow C^6 > A^6 \\Rightarrow C > A$\n$(1), (2) \\Rightarrow B < A < C$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0304/solution_1.webp","alt":"حل سوال 304","aspect_ratio":0.8859}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0304/solution_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0304/solution_1.webp","sha256":"e6a59b7d6420f62ec27bd3586d202674942a842b57808a3face84df8685d8aa8","bytes":16746}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":304,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":30,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0305","source_sha256":"6c6e8e859a259a3fef8a25e6ea1c4c51682dcf676caff83b9488bc0d48521040","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در شکل مقابل، نقطه $a$ را به ریشه سوم، چهارم و مجذور آن وصل کرده‌ایم. کدام گزینه صحیح است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0305/stem_1.webp","alt":"نمودار خط اعداد با نمایش نقاط ریشه سوم، چهارم و مجذور","aspect_ratio":2.1538}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$a_1 + a_2 = 0$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$a_1 + a_2 > 0$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$a_1 + a_4 > 0$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$a_1 + a_4 = 0$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"با توجه به شکل $a < 0$ و $a > -1$ می‌باشد، بنابراین $a$ دارای دو ریشۀ چهارم قرینه است.\nدر نتیجه: $0 < a^2 < \\sqrt[4]{a} < \\sqrt[3]{a} < 1$ و $-1 < -\\sqrt[4]{a} < 0$\n$a_1 = -\\sqrt[4]{a}, a_2 = a^2, a_3 = \\sqrt[3]{a}, a_4 = \\sqrt[4]{a}$\nواضح است که $a_1$ و $a_4$ قرینۀ یکدیگر بوده و $a_1 + a_4 = 0$ می‌باشد. نادرستی سه گزینۀ دیگر بدیهی است."},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0305/solution_2.webp","alt":"حل سوال 305","aspect_ratio":0.2269}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0305/solution_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0305/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0305/solution_2.webp","sha256":"7344afd9f6632ea612be6da888807e150d398c0457c9c3838911bc70db8483cd","bytes":15504},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0305/stem_1.webp","sha256":"98defee3aa4066db014372869caa95e95e7ad2168ec367fa218bfa3172e2f3f0","bytes":1368}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":305,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":30,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0306","source_sha256":"4e72ac500668fa1c39d3cefebd819edf9dc128a6bdf685a7c56e5e6e1f83c47e","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"با توجه به محور اعداد حقیقی زیر، $x$، $y$، $z$ و $t$ از راست به چپ، به ترتیب کدام می‌توانند باشد؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0306/stem_1.webp","alt":"محور اعداد با نمایش متغیرهای x، y، z و t","aspect_ratio":2.383}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$a^2$ ، $\\sqrt{a}$ ، $\\sqrt[3]{a}$ ، $\\sqrt[5]{a}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{a}$ ، $\\sqrt[5]{a}$ ، $a^2$ ، $a^3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$a^3$ ، $\\sqrt[3]{a}$ ، $a^2$ ، $\\sqrt{a}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{a}$ ، $\\sqrt[3]{a}$ ، $a^2$ ، $\\sqrt[5]{a}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"با توجه به شکل $a > 1$ می‌باشد. بنابراین $a^2$ و $a^3$ نیز بین صفر و یک می‌باشند و $\\frac{1}{a} > 1$ است. در نتیجه گزینه‌های 1 و 3 نادرست هستند.\nبرای اعداد بین صفر و یک $a > \\sqrt{a}$ و در نتیجه $-a < -\\sqrt{a}$ می‌باشد در حالی که $a^3 < a$ و $-a^3 > -a$ می‌باشد. بنابراین 2 نادرست و 4 صحیح است."},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0306/solution_2.webp","alt":"حل سوال 306","aspect_ratio":0.2098}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0306/solution_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0306/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0306/solution_2.webp","sha256":"cb1183a64d17c1b00a2a608b75c72e3375d031610b10f2e71382a124a477d983","bytes":22942},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0306/stem_1.webp","sha256":"573d7a459aaa8776c217f039692dfa73fefd6510f6fd66af09b4aca983eacfe2","bytes":1110}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":306,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":30,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0307","source_sha256":"1b1e7165da9260fbdc8bba90fd7cec6b93d01cda3f27672d68f38040c595996e","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $0 < a < 1$ باشد، ساده‌شده عبارت $|a^2 - \\sqrt[3]{a}| - |\\sqrt[4]{a} - a^2| + |a^2 - \\sqrt{a}| - \\sqrt[4]{a}$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"صفر"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2a^2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-2\\sqrt[3]{a}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2\\sqrt[4]{a}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $0 < a < 1$ باشد، خواهیم داشت:\n$\\dots < a^3 < a^2 < a < \\sqrt{a} < \\sqrt[3]{a} < \\dots$\nبنابراین:\n$|\\sqrt{a} - \\sqrt[3]{a}| + |a^2 - \\sqrt{a}| - |\\sqrt[3]{a} - a^2|$\n$= -\\sqrt{a} + \\sqrt[3]{a} - a^2 + \\sqrt{a} - \\sqrt[3]{a} + a^2 = 0$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0307/solution_1.webp","alt":"حل سوال 307","aspect_ratio":0.2105}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0307/solution_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0307/solution_1.webp","sha256":"11f53e77e7e3daa6aac53d3843a1a1ea9302ba2deed3bf0c72e06aaef046b076","bytes":22114}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":307,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":30,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0308","source_sha256":"c7e07a5b549ef60aa12de858aac40e1b29cc23735652c0828f520be344bddb66","subject":"math","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","source_topic_key":"radicals_algebraic_expressions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $a^3 > a^7$ باشد، حدود $a$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$-1 < a < 1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$a > 1$ یا $a < -1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$a > 0$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$a > 1$ یا $-1 < a < 0$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا دو طرف نامساوی را به توان $21$ می‌رسانیم:\n$a^{\\frac{3}{7}} < a^{\\frac{7}{3}} \\Rightarrow (a^{\\frac{3}{7}})^{21} < (a^{\\frac{7}{3}})^{21} \\Rightarrow a^9 < a^{49}$\nاگر $m$ و $n$ اعداد طبیعی و فرد بوده و $m < n$ باشد:\n$a^m < a^n \\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} a > 1 \\\\ -1 < a < 0 \\end{cases} \\qquad a^m > a^n \\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} 0 < a < 1 \\\\ a < -1 \\end{cases}$\nچون $a^9 < a^{49}$ می‌باشد، نتیجه می‌گیرییم: $a > 1$ یا $-1 < a < 0$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0308/solution_1.webp","alt":"حل سوال 308","aspect_ratio":0.253}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0308/solution_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0308/solution_1.webp","sha256":"544d07b121b0d9518bd7122490e482c16373cf43e64341ae55e5b42c1febca46","bytes":18992}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":308,"question_pdf":"5.pdf","question_page":6,"solution_page":30,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true}]}
